hment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-05T20:14:36-07:00","id":1454324,"title":"","content":"<b>Squeaks in the Deep</b> Kickstarter going live on on Friday, July 9th, at<b> 2pm EDT</b>! And mock of the cover!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Squeaks-Cover-Front-Flat.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-09T13:05:21-07:00","id":1454599,"title":"","content":"Kickstarter is delayed because of problems with Kickstarter platform itself. We do not know how long... <img src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tcb/1/16/1f641.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-12T21:11:33-07:00","id":1454790,"title":"","content":"<b>Squeaks in the Deep</b> Kickstarter is starting TODAY, at <b>July 13th at 2 pm EDT</b>! See you in few hours! \ud83d\udc2d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-13T11:32:43-07:00","id":1454847,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/339646881/squeaks-in-the-deep-tabletop-roleplaying-game\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Squeaks In The Deep</b> Kickstarter started!</a> Let the Kickstarter hype beign! \ud83d\udc2d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-13T19:19:44-07:00","id":1454859,"title":"","content":"So with Rodents in this book, are \u201cBadgers\u201d the only canonical uplifted species group not to get player character coverage?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-13T20:39:44-07:00","id":1454863,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1445343-realms-of-pugmire-squeaks-in-the-deep?p=1454859#post1454859\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So with Rodents in this book, are \u201cBadgers\u201d the only canonical uplifted species group not to get player character coverage?</div> </div> </div> </div>From my information - yes, only 'Badgers' from canon are left then. However, we got rumors on ideas of devs team to make Bunnies or Bats in other books - so we clearly have more than enough material.<br /> <br /> <br /> Myself, I would love to see whole one book on Unseen ( maybe with more Things from Age of Man ) and another one, solely dedicated to Fearful Forest ( and probably War of Cats and Dogs, as it was main theater of this War). Unseen is what makes Realms of Pugmire unique setting amongst of 'animal RPGs' - and Fearful Forest is one of central locations of setting, somehow always showing up in my campaigns, one way or another.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-14-2021, 12:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-13T21:07:51-07:00","id":1454864,"title":"","content":"Project is funded and we have first Streach Goals - Guide Screen ( for physical versions only ) and discount on the special T-Shirt in clothes store of Onyx Path.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-14T06:00:38-07:00","id":1454882,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1445343-realms-of-pugmire-squeaks-in-the-deep?p=1454859#post1454859\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So with Rodents in this book, are \u201cBadgers\u201d the only canonical uplifted species group not to get player character coverage?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> To answer your question without answering your question, I quote the Canis Minor FAQ:<br /> <br /> <i>Pugsteady and Onyx Path reserve the right to product official products featuring rules for playing all mentioned species (including dogs, cats, rats, mice, lizards, geckos, turtles, snakes, birds, badgers, otters, polecats, weasels, ferrets, wolverines, and rabbits).</i><br /> <br /> There have been official player character rules for dog (Pugmire), cats (Monarchies of Mau), rats and mice (Squeaks in the Deep), lizards, geckos, turtles, snakes, and birds (Pirates of Pugmire). That leaves badgers, otters, polecats, weasels, ferrets, wolverines, and rabbits. <br /> <br /> Make of that what you will. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15-eddyfate","name":"eddyfate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-14T06:13:43-07:00","id":1454883,"title":"","content":"I really want you to do a Wild West homage setting with the polecats.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-14T08:40:55-07:00","id":1454888,"title":"","content":"RABBITS! \u2764 We need to unlock this Stretch Goal right now! Squeaks are at 23,3k$ now.<br /> 'At $29,000 in Funding \u2013 <b><i>Rabbits Setting Supplement</i></b> \u2013 A PDF supplement detailing the setting information for rabbits in the Realms of Pugmire will be created and automatically added to the rewards list of all backers receiving the Squeaks in the Deep PDF.'","signature":"","edited":